NOTE ON SCOPE AND RISK

This software bridges your locally installed WorkBuddy AI desktop application
to other tools, using your own signed-in account and its own on-disk
credentials. It does not bypass billing: requests consume the quota of the
account you are already signed into.

It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or supported by WorkBuddy, Anthropic,
or OpenAI. The upstream endpoints it calls were determined by observation and
may change without notice. Using it may conflict with the upstream provider's
terms of service; you accept that risk by using it.
